#: llmcord_core/i18n/terms.py
msgid "**Yut in short**"
msgstr ""

#: llmcord_core/i18n/terms.py
msgid "Bring all your pieces once around the board and home before anyone else. On your turn, throw the four sticks: Do = 1 step, Gae = 2, Geol = 3, Yut = 4, Mo = 5."
msgstr ""

#: llmcord_core/i18n/terms.py
msgid "• Yut, Mo and capturing an opponent each earn another throw. Throws you have not used wait in a bank, and you choose the order."
msgstr ""

#: llmcord_core/i18n/terms.py
msgid "• Landing on your own piece stacks them (they move together). Landing on an opponent's piece sends it back to the start. A piece that stops on a corner or the center takes the shortcut."
msgstr ""

#: llmcord_core/i18n/terms.py
msgid "• Back-do moves a piece one step back. A piece still at the start cannot use it, and with no piece on the board it is lost."
msgstr ""

#: llmcord_core/i18n/terms.py
msgid "• Passing the last point takes a piece home; no exact throw is needed."
msgstr ""

#: llmcord_core/i18n/terms.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "• Take longer than {seconds} s and a throw or move is made for you; miss two in a row and you forfeit your seat."
msgstr ""

#: llmcord_core/i18n/terms.py
msgid "• The first to bring every piece home, or the last player standing, takes the pot."
msgstr ""

#: llmcord_core/i18n/terms.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "• The first to bring every piece home, or the last player standing, takes the pot ({ante} each)."
msgstr ""

